    <innerclass refid="class_non_dynamics" prot="public">NonDynamics</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_non_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonDynamics</ref> class, representing static (non-changing) dynamics in the ecosystem model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file contains the definition of the <ref refid="class_non_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonDynamics</ref> class, which implements a type of dynamics where the value remains constant over time. It inherits from <ref refid="class_non_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonMassBasedDynamics</ref> and overrides its methods to maintain the value unchanged.</para>
<para><ref refid="class_non_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonDynamics</ref> is useful for traits or processes that do not evolve during the simulation, such as constant metabolic costs or fixed behavioral modifiers. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
